      "day": 266,
      "content": "ngl been testing NovaMind for a few weeks and it's just... not clicking for me \ud83d\ude2c the latency is brutal when i'm juggling multiple projects\u2014feels like it's always buffering right when i need quick turnaround. and customer support? radio silence. submitted a ticket 3 days ago still waiting lol\n\nfor the price point there's honestly better alternatives out there that just *work* without the headaches. might be good for casual use but if you're doing serious creator work where speed matters, prolly skip this one \ud83e\udd37\u200d\u2640\ufe0f #NotWorthIt #CreatorTools"
