      "day": 266,
      "content": "switched from claude api to novamind assistant last month thinking i'd save money on my content workflow... yeah that didn't work out \ud83d\ude2c\n\nthe hallucinations are actually WILD. like it'll confidently make up stats mid-article and i have to manually fact-check everything now. my old setup caught maybe 10% of that garbage. also the response times are weirdly inconsistent\u2014sometimes snappy, sometimes just sitting there for 30+ seconds on identical prompts?\n\nthe real kicker? customer support ghosted me for 4 days on a billing issue. FOUR DAYS. when you're a solopreneur running on tight margins that's basically forever.\n\nmight just go back to my previous workflow. feels like i'm paying more to get less reliable output \ud83e\udd37\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\n\n#NovaAssistant #SaaS #Disappointed"
