      "content": "honestly been using NovaMind for my tutoring side gig but the usage caps are honestly brutal \ud83d\ude05 like i switched from [other tool] specifically bc the pricing seemed better but i'm constantly hitting the limit before end of week. used to be able to batch my student Q&As no problem, now i'm rationing responses like??? \n\nfor freelance educators this is kind of a dealbreaker ngl. the quality is solid when i can actually use it but having to choose between answering student msgs or prepping lesson materials is wild. maybe the higher tier makes sense but that defeats the whole \"affordable alternative\" thing \ud83d\udc80\n\n#edtech #sideHustle"
